  "description": "I’m a NeuroAI researcher at the Amaranth Foundation, which funds ambitious research in neuroscience. I focus on the intersection of neuroscience and AI safety. I did my B.Sc. in Math and Physics and a PhD in neuroscience at McGill. Previously, I was a software engineer at Google,  a research scientist in brain-computer interfaces at Meta, and a machine learning researcher at Mila."
